its notice is preserved in LICENSE-APPLESKIN.

The Android .hmod port uses the official Horizon Android mod SDK and WIT
contract from Vasysik/horizon-android, vendored under third_party/horizon-mod-sdk:
https://github.com/Vasysik/horizon-android
Pinned release: v0.7.7
Pinned commit: 80700a6f26afe53a368032d8b28bd364f7c3e7e4
SDK license: MIT, preserved in third_party/horizon-mod-sdk/LICENSE.

Vanilla Minecraft 26.3 food components are derived from misode/mcmeta:
https://github.com/misode/mcmeta
Tag: 26.3-summary
Commit: d96c75fec200c4580dd75e033a76341521165461
Path: item_components/data.json
The extracted, pinned subset is food-data/foods-26.3.json.

Local changes: Android .hmod WebAssembly component, main-hand food preview,
projected hunger, food saturation gain, compatible fixed-row icon preview
above the hunger bar with opacity-only pulse, yellow potential-saturation
highlight, sandbox tests,
pinned SDK, generated food table, versioned packaging, GitHub Actions and
PT-BR release reports.
This project is not an official AppleSkin, Horizon, Mojang or Microsoft release.
